        "id": "technical_summary",
        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "# SDGScenes Defensive Baseline Results\n\n## Technical summary\n\nThe H800 smoke run completed a non-official SDGScenes-inspired constrained-optimization baseline on the archived InstructScene validation layouts. The optimizer improved simplified all-target relation satisfaction across bedroom, livingroom, and diningroom while keeping out-of-bounds center delta at zero.\n\nThese rows must be treated as an internal defensive baseline, not an official SDGScenes reproduction and not a direct SOTA ranking.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "accuracy_chart_note",
        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "## Key finding: relation accuracy improves after constrained optimization\n\nThe grouped bar chart compares simplified all-target relation accuracy before and after the SDGScenes-inspired optimizer for each room split. The chart is descriptive evidence for the defensive smoke baseline only; it is not an official SDGScenes result."
      },
      {
        "id": "accuracy_chart_block",
        "type": "chart",
        "chartId": "accuracy_before_after_chart"
      },
      {
        "id": "smoke_summary_table",
        "type": "table",
        "tableId": "smoke_summary"
      },
      {
        "id": "same_protocol_table",
        "type": "table",
        "tableId": "same_protocol_refs"
      },
      {
        "id": "claim_boundary",
        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "## Scope and claim boundary\n\n- Input: archived `layout_boxes` and `repair_target_relations` from the InstructScene relation-aware experiment archive.\n- Optimized variables: object x/z translations only; class, size, y translation, and yaw are preserved.\n- Unsupported vertical relations are passed through rather than optimized.\n- Collision proxy in this export is AABB footprint overlap, not the FCL mesh evaluator.\n- Safe wording: `SDGScenes-inspired constrained optimizer (ours-run defensive smoke)`.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "next_steps",
        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "## Recommended next steps\n\n1. Keep official SDGScenes in the protocol comparison / related-work section unless a shared-protocol reproduction succeeds.\n2. Use the same-protocol InstructScene / Floor-Prior / collision-gated rows as the main paper numbers.\n3. If stronger defensive evidence is needed, rerun the optimized layouts through the full mesh/FCL evaluator.\n"
      }
